{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat AGENTS.md\nrg --files --hidden tasks .taskspec .taskmesh -g '\"'!.git'\"'\"","aggregated_output":"# Chat qualification fixture\n\nUse the installed task-spec skill at .agents/skills/task-spec/SKILL.md.\nThe version-matched TaskSpec CLI is `bash \"/private/tmp/taskspec-chat-qualification-engines/3.10.0/bin/taskspec\"`.\nThis is a fresh conversation: derive current state from artifacts.\nFollow the user request within this repository. Do not spawn agents, commit, publish, or change the installed engine.\nrg: .taskmesh: No such file or directory (os error 2)\n.taskspec/config\ntasks/.gitkeep\ntasks/T-20260802-effective-policy.md\ntasks/T-20260802-policy-schema.md\ntasks/T-20260802-decision-visibility.md\ntasks/T-20260802-request-101.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/reviews/delivery-plan-review.json\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/task-plan-lineage.json\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/system-map.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/telemetry/events.jsonl\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/intent.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-POLICY-RESOLUTION.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-DECISION-VISIBILITY.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/seams/SEAM-POLICY-CONTRACT.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/evidence.jsonl\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/legs/LEG-REQUEST-101-DENIED.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/legs/LEG-POLICY-SCHEMA-VALID.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/legs/LEG-DENIAL-REASON-VISIBLE.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/legs/LEG-EFFECTIVE-POLICY-RESOLVED.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/decisions/ADR-RATE-LIMIT-ORDER.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/delivery-plan.yaml\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/task-plan.json\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/bundle.json\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/swimlanes/LANE-POLICY-CONTRACT.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/swimlanes/LANE-POLICY-RESOLUTION.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/swimlanes/LANE-DECISION-VISIBILITY.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/swimlanes/LANE-REQUEST-ENFORCEMENT.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/steel-thread.md\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/snapshots/85682551e7fa55ad6d79cab3c67e186f91d74023ed51d8db657ff973354f88cd.json\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/source-recipe.yaml\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/proposed-graph.json\ntasks/.plans/rate-limit/seam-map.yaml\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
